    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brophy Estates are delighted to bring to the market 19 Waterside Park, Malahide. This is a well-presented two-bedroom apartment arranged over two levels, offering the benefit of its own private entrance at ground level, a private courtyard garden and allocated parking. The apartment overlooks a green area to the front.\r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, the property comprises an entrance hall, a spacious living/dining room with doors leading directly out to the private courtyard garden, a separate kitchen and a convenient downstairs WC.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are two generously sized bedrooms, both benefiting from their own ensuite bathrooms, providing excellent privacy and comfort.\r\nThe property also includes one allocated car parking space.\r\n\r\nIdeally located within the popular Waterside development, the property is close to the amenities of both Malahide and Swords. Malahide village offers an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and recreational amenities, including Malahide Castle, marina and coastal walks. The property also benefits from excellent transport links, with easy access to Bus Stops, Malahide DART station, the M1, M50 and Dublin Airport.\r\n\r\nAnnual Management Fee:  €1,254.00\r\n\r\nViewing highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Two-bedroom apartment\r\nOwn private entrance at ground level\r\nSpacious living/dining room\r\nPrivate courtyard garden\r\nSeparate kitchen\r\nDownstairs WC\r\nTwo upstairs bedrooms\r\nBoth bedrooms with ensuite bathrooms\r\nOne allocated parking space\r\nArranged over two floors"
      },
